  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your fiery spells leave choking cinders and clinging soot in their wake.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ashen Spell<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the number of rounds creatures are covered with ashes and soot, up to a maximum of twice the spell’s original level. If you expend one use of mythic power when casting an ashen spell, creatures are affected as mythic glitterdust.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
